---

<MainLayout
  title="号码百科"
  description="号码标记清除网号码百科：涵盖号码误标原因、标记清除方法、AI标记算法、二次号码、400号码、高频外呼防标记、申诉被驳回等实用指南。"
  keywords="号码百科,号码标记,号码误标,号码标记清除教程,号码标记申诉,AI标记,骚扰电话标记"
>
  <div class="bg-white border-b border-gray-200">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-10 text-center">
      <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">号码标记清除网 · 号码百科</h1>
      <p class="text-gray-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto">一个号码为什么会被标记？怎么正确地清除标记、防止复标？这里有你要的答案。</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12">
    <div class="space-y-8">
      {posts.map((post) => (
        <article class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-gray-200 p-6 hover:shadow-md hover:border-blue-300 transition-all">
          <a href={`/zh-CN/blog/${post.slug}/`} class="block">
            <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-500 mb-2">
              <time datetime={post.date}>{post.date}</time>
              {post.tags.map((tag) => (
                <span key={tag} class="px-2 py-0.5 bg-blue-50 text-blue-600 rounded-full text-xs">{tag}</span>
              ))}
            </div>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2 hover:text-blue-600 transition-colors">{post.title}</h2>
            <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">{post.excerpt}</p>
          </a>
        </article>
      ))}
    </div>
  </div>
</MainLayout>